  "lab": {
    "_status": "first pass, untested — new system (2026-07-21). Win condition is securing this tile ALONE (DESIGN.md §13) — clearing dens is not a win requirement, just a source of guaranteed clues/outposts/army-building along the way.",
    "min_distance_from_base": 20,
    "_min_distance_note": "Farther out than dens.min_distance_from_base (14) — the lab should read as the map's ultimate destination, found only after real exploration, not something a fresh player stumbles onto in the first few scouting actions.",
    "guardian_defense": 300,
    "_guardian_defense_note": "Static — doesn't scale with anything (DESIGN.md §13: 'tougher than anything else encountered'). Set well above a max-level (5) den's defense (dens.siege.den_defense_base + den_defense_per_level*4 = 80) so securing the lab demands a real, late-game army — roughly 150 militia at attack_per_unit=2, or an equivalent knight/sniper mix."
  },

